<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Total raised at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Total raised at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total was raised to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from &quot;marker performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
